---
import Section from "../ui/Section.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../ui/SectionHeader.astro";

interface Props {
  bg?: "white" | "gray";
}

const { bg = "white" } = Astro.props;
---

<Section bg={bg}>
  <SectionHeader title="Work Experience" subtitle="Professional history and accomplishments" />

  <div class="space-y-12">
    <!-- ProspectWise - Senior Software Engineer -->
    <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-1">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">ProspectWise</h3>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">Senior Software Engineer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">June 2019 – Present · 7+ years</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Own day-to-day technical and product operations for a licensed Ruby on Rails app, while consulting the CTO on major
          architecture and infrastructure, resulting in smoother operations and quicker decisions.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Serve as the main contact for the company’s primary customer, handling production support, feature requests, and
          delivery priorities, then turning those requests into technical plans and production features.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Designed and built an idempotent daily sync that imports and updates third-party reviews for 25,000 customer accounts
          while preventing duplicates and tracking data completeness.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Scaled the platform from roughly 8,000 to 25,000 customer accounts, supporting growth to five million requests per
          day.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Maintain p95 response times below 90 ms across six application servers, keeping the application responsive and stable
          during peak business hours.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Moved resource-heavy reporting and automated smoke tests to AWS Lambda, reducing load on the main Rails application.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Led the application upgrade from Rails 4 to Rails 8 while continuing regular feature delivery.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Added New Relic monitoring to identify bottlenecks, optimize queries, and track production performance.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Replaced Amplitude with PostHog after investigating bot traffic and testing application-level IP filtering.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Built a self-hosted sentiment analysis service using Ollama and Llama, keeping customer data private while identifying
          issues and recommended actions from customer reviews.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- ProspectWise - Software Engineer -->
    <div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-1">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">ProspectWise</h3>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">Software Engineer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">Jan 2017 – June 2019 · 2.5 years</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-green-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Built features with APIs and a React frontend using Apollo and GraphQL, delivering features that automated manual
          workflows.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-green-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Improved application reliability by identifying performance bottlenecks, resolving production issues, and reducing
          failures.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-green-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Replaced ActiveRecord queries with SQL, improving application performance.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-green-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Adopted agile best practices and delivered iterative features and API implementations.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- CapLinked -->
    <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between mb-1">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">CapLinked</h3>
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">QA to Web Developer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">Nov 2013 – Dec 2016 · 3 years</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-purple-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Implemented new features and resolved bugs in Ruby on Rails web app on a small agile team, improving user experience
          and system stability.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-purple-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Implemented core API (Ruby Grape) including the CapLinked API gem.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-purple-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Added RSpec and Cucumber tests, reviewed code, and helped maintain consistent development practices.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-purple-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Conducted code reviews to ensure adherence to best practices and maintain code quality.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-purple-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Interviewed, hired, and mentored a junior QA analyst, strengthening team capabilities.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-purple-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Checking Automated Tests - Cucumber, RSpec, writing Gherkin.
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
          <span class="text-purple-500 mt-1">•</span>
          Test planning, manual, White Box, Grey Box testing.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
